# Licence of this repository: read the scope first

This repository mixes code from several authors under different terms. The PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 below
applies **only** to Tiago Febra's (skydoy) own work in this fork:

- `installer/` (web-installer builds, `models.yaml`, `gen_models.py`, `packages/`: web UI `report.js`, `webui.yaml`,
  `firmware-update.yaml`, `update-check.yaml`, `identify.yaml`, `performance.yaml`, `boot-animation-m5stack.yaml`,
  `splash_icon.png`)
- `static/` (web installer page, board pictures, wiring diagram, icons)
- `docs/*.md` and the logo and brand assets in `docs/` (`icon.*`, `logo-*`, `logo-animated.svg`, `logo-animation.*`,
  `social-preview.*`)
- `homeassistant/blueprints/esphome_altherma_update_available.yaml`
- `tools/report-worker/`
- `boards/common/diagnostics-esp32.yaml`
- `README.pt.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`, `.editorconfig`
- `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/`, `.github/FUNDING.yml`, `.github/CODEOWNERS`, `.github/pull_request_template.md`
- Tiago's own changes and additions in the files listed under "Not covered" below, but never the upstream code in them

**Not covered** by this licence:

- **Upstream esphome-altherma** (Jan Åge Johnsen and contributors): `components/altherma_hub/`, `confs/`, `boards/`
  (other than the file named above), `homeassistant/emoncms/`, `homeassistant/blueprints/emonncms_heatpump_sender.yaml`,
  `.github/dependabot.yml`, the screenshots in `docs/img/`, and the upstream parts of `README.md` and of the CI
  workflows in `.github/workflows/`. Upstream declares no licence, so its author keeps all rights. Using, copying or
  sharing that code depends on the author's terms, not on this file.
- **ESPAltherma-derived files** (Raomin and contributors), under the MIT License: `components/altherma_hub/converters.h`,
  `components/altherma_hub/labeldef.h` and the model definitions that `confs/` is converted from. See
  [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
- **ESPHome's C++ runtime (GPL-3.0)** and the other build dependencies that are compiled into every firmware image
  (`.bin`). A firmware image as a whole is not under this licence. See [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
- `CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md`, adapted from the Contributor Covenant 2.1 (CC BY 4.0).

